-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/3 (12.6.2025): רכזי מקצוע בבית ספר שש שנתי – עדכון
-- Subject coordinators in a six-year school from school year תשפ"ו: when
-- each division has its own coordinator, when one teacher earns two
-- coordination allowances, and when a single six-year coordinator is
-- appointed, with that coordinator's allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ו/3 רכזי מקצוע בבית ספר שש שנתי`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (12.6.2025), reference, addressee, subject line and the circular it updates (תשע"ד/4 of 8.1.2014); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 A recital: a teacher in a six-year school may be employed in both divisions, under different reforms (Oz LaTmura in the upper division, Ofek Hadash in the junior high), with one salary or with two employers.
-- akn:preamble/p20 A recital: the circular follows circular תשע"ד/4 of 8.1.2014.
-- akn:preamble/p21 The link to circular תשע"ד/4 and the subject of the update; the earlier circular is not restated here.

DECLARE `division` IS ONE OF
    `the junior high`
    `the upper division`

@desc A six-year school's subject, as far as the coordinator rules ask about it.
DECLARE `subject in a six-year school` HAS
    `each division justifies its own coordinator` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the hours and teachers of the subject in each division separately allow a coordinator, by the rules for appointing coordinators
    `the divisions together justify a coordinator` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the hours and teachers in both divisions together, at the employer, allow a coordinator
    `the subject is mathematics or English`        IS A BOOLEAN

@desc A teacher who coordinates the subject, as far as the circular asks.
DECLARE `coordinator` HAS
    `coordinates in the junior high`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `coordinates in the upper division`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `frontal hours in the junior high`       IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours in the upper division`    IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours in the position`          IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours the teacher's position includes

DECLARE `coordinator action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a six-year coordinator`
    `allot a frontal hour from the upper division's coordinators' basket` HAS `hours allotted` IS A NUMBER

-- The update applies from school year תשפ"ו (school years are named by the
-- calendar year they open in: תשפ"ו = 2025).
@ref akn:preamble/p22
GIVEN `school year opening in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year the school year opens in (2025 for תשפ"ו)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the update applies in` `school year opening in` IF
    `school year opening in` AT LEAST 2025

-- The threshold §1ב and §3ב share: frontal hours in both divisions together
-- of at least 50% of the frontal hours the position includes, and in any
-- case at least 8.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN c IS A `coordinator`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the frontal-hours threshold` c IF
    LET together MEANS c's `frontal hours in the junior high` PLUS c's `frontal hours in the upper division`
    IN  together AT LEAST 0.5 TIMES c's `frontal hours in the position`
        AND together AT LEAST 8

§§ `1 A coordinator in each division`

-- 1א: where the principal appoints a coordinator in each division
-- separately, each is entitled to the full coordination allowance under the
-- agreement that applies to him in that division.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`, `the same teacher in both` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full allowances under 1א` s `the same teacher in both` IS
    IF s's `each division justifies its own coordinator` AND NOT `the same teacher in both`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

-- 1ב: the same teacher, teaching and coordinating in both divisions, and
-- only when the frontal-hours threshold is met: two allowances, each by its
-- division's rules and on its division's salary.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b/p2 akn:art_1__para_b/p3 akn:art_1__para_b/p4
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`, c IS A `coordinator`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowances under 1ב` s c IS
    IF     s's `each division justifies its own coordinator`
       AND c's `coordinates in the junior high`
       AND c's `coordinates in the upper division`
       AND c's `frontal hours in the junior high` GREATER THAN 0
       AND c's `frontal hours in the upper division` GREATER THAN 0
       AND `meets the frontal-hours threshold` c
    THEN 2
    ELSE 0

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_03-a: a teacher who coordinates the subject in both
-- divisions but teaches fewer frontal hours than the threshold. 1ב gives two
-- allowances "only when" the threshold is met; §2 forbids the six-year
-- coordinator instead; 1א speaks of a coordinator appointed in each division.
-- The reading adopted: 1א is about two different teachers, and below the
-- threshold the same teacher has no allowance under this circular.
`a teacher coordinating both divisions with 6 frontal hours` MEANS
    `coordinator` WITH
        `coordinates in the junior high`       IS TRUE
        `coordinates in the upper division`    IS TRUE
        `frontal hours in the junior high`     IS 3
        `frontal hours in the upper division`  IS 3
        `frontal hours in the position`        IS 20

`a subject each division can coordinate` MEANS
    `subject in a six-year school` WITH
        `each division justifies its own coordinator`  IS TRUE
        `the divisions together justify a coordinator` IS TRUE
        `the subject is mathematics or English`        IS FALSE

-- 1א read as also covering one teacher appointed in each division: a full
-- allowance per division, with no frontal-hours condition.
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`, c IS A `coordinator`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowances under 1א read for the same teacher` s c IS
    IF s's `each division justifies its own coordinator`
    THEN (IF c's `coordinates in the junior high` THEN 1 ELSE 0)
         PLUS (IF c's `coordinates in the upper division` THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    ELSE 0

`1א read for the same teacher gives two full allowances where 1ב gives none` MEANS
        `allowances under 1ב` `a subject each division can coordinate` `a teacher coordinating both divisions with 6 frontal hours` EQUALS 0
    AND `allowances under 1א read for the same teacher` `a subject each division can coordinate` `a teacher coordinating both divisions with 6 frontal hours` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `1א read for the same teacher gives two full allowances where 1ב gives none`

-- 1ב, last line: for the maximum number of roles a teacher may fill, the
-- two count as one.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b/p5
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`, c IS A `coordinator`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `roles counted for the maximum` s c IS
    IF `allowances under 1ב` s c EQUALS 2 THEN 1
    ELSE IF c's `coordinates in the junior high` AND c's `coordinates in the upper division`
         THEN 2
         ELSE IF c's `coordinates in the junior high` OR c's `coordinates in the upper division`
              THEN 1
              ELSE 0

§§ `2 No six-year coordinator where each division can have its own`

@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `coordinator action`
DECIDE `no six-year coordinator` s IS
    IF s's `each division justifies its own coordinator`
    THEN PARTY `the school principal`
         SHANT `appoint a six-year coordinator`
         LEST BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/3 §2: from תשפ\"ו no six-year coordinator where each division can have its own; two allowances under 1ב instead"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `3 The six-year coordinator`

-- §3: only where each division does not justify its own coordinator but
-- the two together do; and only a teacher with frontal hours in both
-- divisions (3א) meeting the threshold (3ב).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`, c IS A `coordinator`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be appointed six-year coordinator` s c IF
        NOT s's `each division justifies its own coordinator`
    AND s's `the divisions together justify a coordinator`
    AND c's `frontal hours in the junior high` GREATER THAN 0
    AND c's `frontal hours in the upper division` GREATER THAN 0
    AND `meets the frontal-hours threshold` c

§§ `4 The six-year coordinator's allowance`

-- 4א–4ב: 9% in mathematics and English, 8% in every other subject
-- "בהתאם למספר המורים והשעות של המקצוע אשר תחת אחריותו". The circular
-- gives no scale of teachers and hours; the reading adopted is a flat 8%
-- (F-2025-26_tashpo_03-b).
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the six-year coordinator's rate` s IS
    IF s's `the subject is mathematics or English` THEN 0.09 ELSE 0.08

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_03-b: 4ב ties the 8% to the number of teachers and
-- hours in the coordinator's charge, and nothing in the circular says how.
`the circular gives a scale of teachers and hours for 4ב's rate` MEANS FALSE

`4ב's rate depends on counts the circular does not scale` MEANS
    NOT `the circular gives a scale of teachers and hours for 4ב's rate`
#ASSERT `4ב's rate depends on counts the circular does not scale`

-- 4ג: on the teacher's full salary in both divisions that is the base for
-- percentage allowances, weighted to a 100% position.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c
GIVEN `base salary in both divisions` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary in both divisions together that is the base for percentage allowances
      `position fraction in both divisions` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's position in both divisions together (1 = 100%)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary weighted to a full position` `base salary in both divisions` `position fraction in both divisions` IS
    `base salary in both divisions` DIVIDED BY `position fraction in both divisions`

-- 4ד: up to one frontal hour in the upper division, from the upper
-- division's coordinators' hours basket, as the principal allots.
@ref akn:art_4__para_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `coordinator action`
DECIDE `an hour from the basket` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `allot a frontal hour from the upper division's coordinators' basket` h
          PROVIDED h AT MOST 1

§§§ `4 The six-year coordinator's allowance, assembled`

-- The rate (4א–4ב) on the salary weighted to a full position (4ג).
@export The monthly coordination allowance of a six-year subject coordinator under circular תשפ"ו/3
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a six-year school` @desc the subject and whether the divisions justify coordinators
      `base salary in both divisions` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary in both divisions together that is the base for percentage allowances
      `position fraction in both divisions` IS A NUMBER @desc the position in both divisions together (1 = 100%)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `six-year coordinator's allowance` s `base salary in both divisions` `position fraction in both divisions` IS
    `the six-year coordinator's rate` s
        TIMES `the salary weighted to a full position` `base salary in both divisions` `position fraction in both divisions`

-- akn:conclusions The signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples (hours and salaries are placeholders).
`a teacher with 10 frontal hours in both` MEANS
    `coordinator` WITH
        `coordinates in the junior high`       IS TRUE
        `coordinates in the upper division`    IS TRUE
        `frontal hours in the junior high`     IS 5
        `frontal hours in the upper division`  IS 5
        `frontal hours in the position`        IS 18

#ASSERT `allowances under 1ב` `a subject each division can coordinate` `a teacher with 10 frontal hours in both` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `roles counted for the maximum` `a subject each division can coordinate` `a teacher with 10 frontal hours in both` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the update applies in` 2025 AND NOT `the update applies in` 2024

`a small subject` MEANS
    `subject in a six-year school` WITH
        `each division justifies its own coordinator`  IS FALSE
        `the divisions together justify a coordinator` IS TRUE
        `the subject is mathematics or English`        IS TRUE

#ASSERT `may be appointed six-year coordinator` `a small subject` `a teacher with 10 frontal hours in both`
#ASSERT NOT `may be appointed six-year coordinator` `a subject each division can coordinate` `a teacher with 10 frontal hours in both`
#ASSERT `six-year coordinator's allowance` `a small subject` 8000 0.8 EQUALS 900

#TRACE `no six-year coordinator` `a subject each division can coordinate` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `appoint a six-year coordinator` AT 1
#TRACE `an hour from the basket` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `allot a frontal hour from the upper division's coordinators' basket` 1 AT 1
